Maɓɓina Synix e huuwugo kuuje kalfinaaji nder nder yeeso yahugo.

GitHub koode nastugo:

{0}

Koode'en ɓe jaɓɓi nder karallaagal. Taƴa OK ngam udduki GitHub, ɓesda koode, e jaɓugo Synix.

Wondiri hokkugo haala GitHub ngal?

{0}

Yi'i fannuuji baylitol arandeeji nden ngam tabbitinde ɓe ngalaa bayanuuji goɗɗi.

Ɗu'um ɗon ɗaɓɓita ɓesngu dow: {0}
Jaɓɓorgo Winndannde yeesoDaa server add-on import history and recovery copies stored by Synix nden kadi ittaama.
Fuu ardiije backup server ɗon hawrata to on suɓii haala dow.

Ɗuɓɓugo defte ɗe'e ngam permanent?

{0}
{1:f}

Fiilooji server ɗon ɗon ɗon ɗon maɓɓinaay.

Synix fuɗɗii yahugo to:

{0}

Ɓeeɓre Synix ɓesnguɗe e Discord webhooks je waawi warugo dow PC kesum bee ɗemngal darnuki ɓesngu. Hokka ɗum bee deftere; ɗum waawataa warugo.

Synix fuuri to:

{0}

Deftere nde'e walaa ko ɓeydaama, ngam non njokkee ɗum to goɗɗum goɗɗun. Synix ɓesnguɗe jaɓɓorɗe e webhooks Discord footi waawi warugo nder PC feere.

